Salamander Drums Edits

The original audio files included some silent audio before the drum hits in almost all samples, 
causing unnecessary latency. These files (in OH folder) are an edited set of the original audio files with the extra 
silence trimmed from them, so that no changes are necessary to existing SFZ files to account for it. 
They also correct some end of sample issues.


